#: NAVIGATION.md:1
msgid "Masterclass 22.05: Machine learning collective variables with Pytorch"
msgstr ""

#: NAVIGATION.md:3
msgid ""
"This Masterclass describes how to design data-driven collective variables "
"using machine learning (ML) methods. In particular, two methods will be "
"presented. In the first (DeepLDA), the CVs are optimized as classifiers to "
"distinguish metastable states. In the second (DeepTICA) the slow modes of "
"the simulations are extracted from a (biased) simulation and used as CVs."
msgstr ""

#: NAVIGATION.md:5
msgid ""
"This lesson was given as part of the PLUMED masterclass series in 2022. It "
"includes:"
msgstr "このレッスンは、2022年の PLUMED Masterclass シリーズの一環として実施された。内容は次のとおりである。"

